.vscode
# …except the fixture packages under test-programs/, whose `.vscode/tasks.json`
# IS the test input.  VN-M3's `test_project_actions.nim` `staticRead`s
# `test-programs/noir_verification/.vscode/tasks.json`, so without this
# negation the file is absent from a fresh clone and the `vm-unit` and
# `vm-unit-js` lanes fail to COMPILE — not to assert.  A parent directory that
# is excluded cannot have its children re-included, so the directory itself is
# what has to be named here.
!test-programs/*/.vscode/
